taken a couple
> >>>>>>>>>> of minutes after boot, with the device having been idle since =
boot.
> >>>>>>>>>> The cases tested are:
> >>>>>>>>>> cpuidle_6_6.txt      =3D 6.6 kernel
> >>>>>>>>>> cpuidle_6_12.txt     =3D 6.6 kernel with teo commits up to 6.1=
2
