> >>>>>>>>>
> >>>>>>>>> FWIW the mainline results look the most reasonable, from a 3000=
0 feet view
> >>>>>>>>> anyway:
> >>>>>>>>> Cluster       State           above   below   usage   above%  b=
elow%
